imapsync (IMAP transfer tool)

imapsync is a command line tool that allows you to migrate mailbox
data from one IMAP server to another.

Optional features need extra Perl modules:

  OAuth2 login: libwww-perl perl-LWP-Protocol-https perl-JSON
                perl-html-parser perl-Crypt-OpenSSL-RSA, plus
                JSON::WebToken and Crypt::OpenSSL::PKCS12
                (not on SlackBuilds.org)
  CGI mode:     perl-CGI
  Memory stats: perl-Proc-ProcessTable
  Self-tests:   perl-Test-MockObject (imapsync --tests only)
